  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/C2/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE: the default is still on both ir.py:1032 (dataclass) and ir.py:1079 (Edge.create), but the 'hundreds of call sites' cost premise is gone. AST census over packages/*/src: 531 Edge.create sites in 168 files, 0 omit evidence_type - enforced since ea4d53bb28 (2026-09-19, INV-nudoj, satisfied) by producer_coherence.edge_sites_without_evidence_type, asserted empty in test_producer_coherence.py::TestEveryProducerNamesItsPathway and scripts/check-producer-axis-coherence:111. Tests still lean on the default: 432 of 577 test-side Edge.create calls omit it. Residual = remove the two defaults and update about 432 test call sites (or give tests a helper). Title re-scoped. ROOT-CAUSE GROUP: open-by-default contract guarded only by an external checker (with INV-linan, INV-votoj, WI-kajip). Status unchanged."  # 557b
